==============================================================================
USAGE REQUIREMENTS FOR FORKS & DERIVATIVE WORKS
==============================================================================

You are free to use this codebase as a starter template for your own personal website,
provided that you:
- Replace ALL data in `lib/data/` with your own information.
- Replace ALL images, assets, and resume files in `public/` and `app/assets/` with your own assets.
- Remove all personal references to Nicholas Benson / Nick Frost before deploying or publishing.
